From da6fbfec6c84c2123578fad99ad7b50976f0b6cb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chen Xiaohui <graych@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 17:57:26 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 08/11] virtio-devices: complete worker pause and resume
 handshakes

Publish each pause event before waking workers and wait for every resume acknowledgement before another pause. Keep shared helpers, custom net/vhost-user workers and regression tests together.

Device-worker half of original patch 0007, independent of the vCPU signal mechanism.
